sequenceDiagram
  actor Clerk as Store Clerk
  participant UI as React Frontend
  participant API as Express /api/v1
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Clerk->>UI: Finalize paid sale
  UI->>API: POST /sales/{id}/checkout + Idempotency-Key
  API->>API: Verify session, role, tender, amounts
  API->>DB: BEGIN; lock affected inventory rows
  DB-->>API: Locked available quantities
  alt Paid and all items in stock
    API->>DB: Insert verified receipt/payment and stock movements
    API->>DB: Decrease stock; finalize sale and idempotency result; COMMIT
    DB-->>API: Committed sale and receipt
    API-->>UI: 200 Paid; receipt + low-stock status
  else Stock unavailable or tender not verified
    API->>DB: ROLLBACK
    API-->>UI: Conflict / pending verification
  end
  UI-->>Clerk: Show confirmed result or clear error
